tml_url":"https://github.com/fstxz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fstxz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fstxz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fstxz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fstxz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fstxz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fstxz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fstxz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fstxz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fstxz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-27T18:13:12Z","updated_at":"2025-10-27T18:13:12Z","body":"> Also are you using Wayland or X11, you list both, or is that just how it displays it?\n\nIt looks like Godot displays both when you are on Wayland but Godot itself is running through XWayland. When you set `Prefer Wayland` editor setting to true, Godot will display only Wayland in system info.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3452670847/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3460489425","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112096#issuecomment-3460489425","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112096","id":3460489425,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7OQuDR","user":{"login":"deralmas","id":31065808,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMDY1ODA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31065808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas","html_url":"https://github.com/deralmas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-29T09:09:43Z","updated_at":"2025-10-29T09:09:43Z","body":"> Sounds like:\n> - https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111175\n\nYe. I'll elaborate below.\n\n> It looks like Godot displays both when you are on Wayland but Godot itself is running through XWayland. When you set Prefer Wayland editor setting to true, Godot will display only Wayland in system info.\n\nIndeed. For reference, here's how to read the system string:\n\n> Ubuntu 25.10 25.10 on Wayland\n\nThis means that you're using a Wayland *compositor* but...\n\n> X11 display driver\n\n... The engine is talking to it with the (default) X11 *display driver* (which is our way to say \"backend\"), thanks to XWayland.\n\nWe're keeping the X11 backend the default due to its maturity but unfortunately XWayland is known to be quite funky at times.\n\nThat said, there's reason to believe that this isn't display-server specific and perhaps driver related as, from what I can tell, everybody suffering from this issue is using NVIDIA + Vulkan.\n\nSince a user reported [seeing this issue on both native X11 and XWayland](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111175#issuecomment-3369018569), I'm going to consolidate this issue into #111175 and remove \"(Wayland)\" from its title.\n\nThank you for reporting!","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3460489425/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]